  "question": "What fast food restaurant are present inside a 90 kilometers boundary toward the southwest of Broadbent Arena, Louisville, KY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-85.745629 38.200638)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-85.745629 38.200638)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 202.5 AND 247.5;\n",
